   "title": "A fracture: resuscitate → reduce → hold → x-ray → rehabilitate. Is it OPEN? Is a COMPLICATION developing?",
   "lines": [
    "goals: restore length, alignment, rotation and translation · move early · avoid healing complications · improve function"
   ]
  },
